      "content": "yo i think i figured something out. i was watching the charts during that sudden drop this morning and i actually felt my heart racing way before the volume spiked on the screen. like it was a physical reflex to the market movement. i've noticed this happening a few times now where my pulse and the volatility seem to sync up. can u explain how my autonomic nervous system might be reacting to the market data stream like that?",
