    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it feels like more than just stress. it's like a literal physical synchronization. like, if i focus on my breathing and get my heart rate into a certain rhythm, the price action follows that exact pattern minutes later. it's almost like my body is picking up on the frequency of the market before the data even hits the screen. how can i tell if this is actually a bio-feedback loop between me and the algorithmic flow?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
